# Current SEO Checks

## Page Quality

- Title validation
- Meta description validation
- H1 validation
- Thin content detection

## Technical SEO

- Canonical tag
- Viewport meta tag
- Schema.org JSON-LD
- HTTP status validation

## Images

- Missing ALT attributes

## Links

- Internal link analysis

## Site-wide Checks

- Duplicate titles
- Duplicate meta descriptions

## Security

- Google Safe Browsing validation

